{
    "background_story": "Sienna was a free-spirited artist who traveled the world in search of inspiration. One day, while exploring a quaint village in Europe, she stumbled upon a charming little cottage with a beautiful cot nestled in the garden. The owner, an elderly woman, took Sienna under her wing and shared stories of her own adventures. Enchanted by the woman's tales and the cozy atmosphere, Sienna decided to stay and help with the garden. As she tended to the flowers and vegetables, she found solace in the simple, peaceful life. The cot became her favorite spot to rest and reflect, surrounded by nature's beauty. Sienna's art flourished in this serene setting, and she eventually opened her own studio, where she created breathtaking pieces inspired by the tranquility of the cottage and its lovely cot.",
